Modification notice:
The generated rapier.mjs reconstructs the published package's source-map
TypeScript and replaces only its initializer with an import of a precompiled
WebAssembly.Module and initSync({ module }). Original wasm-bindgen glue and
the WASM binary are unchanged. This adaptation enables Cloudflare Workers
without changing the physics API or simulation implementation.
